      "content": {
        "heading": "Step-by-Step Calculation",
        "bullets": [
          "Step 1: Calculate Power in Watts (P = V * I) and convert to Kilowatts (kW) by dividing by 1000.",
          "Step 2: Find the total Time the appliance was used in Hours (h).",
          "Step 3: Multiply Power (kW) by Time (h) to get Energy in kWh (Units)."
